
  db_audit_gm -- PgBouncer connection pooler node

  Configuration:  /etc/pgbouncer/pgbouncer.ini  (databases, pool sizes, pool mode)
                  the GM's settings, which win over it (read-only):
                  /usr/local/lib/gm/pgbouncer-gm.ini
                  what PgBouncer reads: /run/pgbouncer-conf/pgbouncer.ini
  Console:        psql            (database pgbouncer as role dba, dba's password;
                                   SHOW POOLS; SHOW STATS; SHOW CLIENTS; SHOW CONFIG;)
                  from the bastion: psql -h <this node> -p 6432 -U dba pgbouncer
  Logs:           /var/log/pgbouncer/pgbouncer.log
  Apply changes:  sudo gm-reload-pgbouncer   reload the configuration
  Check:          sudo gm-validate           public validator (envelopes, server)

  DO NOT TAMPER with SSH, sudo, the gm-* wrappers, the validator or the
  GM's files under /usr/local/lib/gm.

